B.aa2=new A.d0("How","On the other screen, open nosus.foo/go. On your phone, open Chat, tap Open on any screen and scan the QR it shows. Match the number, then choose what that screen can open.",!1)
B.aau=new A.d0("Your account stays on your phone","The other screen only gets the items you approve, and only while the session is open.",!1)
