B.aad=new A.d0("What and where","Choose a file or write a note. Send it to You, to one of your groups, or to Anyone with a link. Anyone with a link needs no account to open it.",!1)
B.aa7=new A.d0("How it opens","For a link, turn on one of: One open, Watermarked, or Traceable copies. Each one says what it does right under it.",!1)
B.a9U=new A.d0("Opening a link or code","Send \u2192 Open a link or code. Codes work once and expire.",!1)
B.aaz=new A.d0("Sending nearby","Sending between two phones on the same Wi-Fi was removed. Send a link instead.",!1)
