B.aaL=new A.jq("send","Send","One flow: what, where, how.",B.Et,B.ajp,B.anp)
B.aay=new A.d0("How it works","It is encrypted on your phone first. The key goes in the link, after the # sign, which browsers never send to a server. The first person to open the link gets it, and the stored copy is deleted.",!1)
B.a9R=new A.d0("Limits","Up to 10 files and 50 MB together in one link. Instead of a link you can ask for a 6-digit code to type in. While that code is unused, a copy of the key is kept on our server for up to 10 minutes.",!1)
B.aal=new A.d0("It really is one open","If a chat app previews the link, that counts as the open. The person then sees that it was already opened, which tells you something got to it first.",!0)
B.aa0=new A.d0("Did they open it?","Links you sent, on Send, shows if each one was opened and when. Nobody learns who opened it. Signed in, you are told when it happens: to do that, our server knows which account sent which link (never what is in it) until it is opened or expires. Turn off Link opened in Settings \u2192 Notifications and new links are not tied to you. Not signed in, a link is tied to no one.",!1)
B.ams=s([B.aay,B.a9R,B.aal,B.aa0],t.eH)
B.ap5=s(["burn","burn note","burn file","secret","self destruct","one time","password","anonymous","size limit","opened","read receipt"],t.s)
B.aaM=new A.jq("one-open","One open","A note or file that is gone after the first person opens it. No account needed on either end.",B.wm,B.ams,B.ap5)
B.wk=new A.b_(61170,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9T=new A.d0("How it works","Watermarked links are made from a file in one of your groups, so Send adds the file to a group first. You set how long the link works and how many times it can be opened.",!1)
B.aak=new A.d0("What you see","Each link has a log of when it was opened. You can revoke it at any time.",!1)
B.a9Q=new A.d0("In a browser","A browser cannot block screenshots. The name on every page is what points back to the reader.",!0)
