B.aah=new A.d0("Watermarks","Your email and the time are drawn over every page you open. A photo of the screen carries them too, so a leaked page points back to who opened it.",!1)
B.a9N=new A.d0("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.a9W=new A.d0("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.akt=s([B.aah,B.a9N,B.a9W],t.eH)
B.apo=s(["watermark","screenshot","screen record","capture","leak"],t.s)
B.aaJ=new A.jq("watermarking","Watermarks and screenshots","Open files carry your name on screen, and on Android screenshots are blocked.",B.wk,B.akt,B.apo)
B.abC=new A.b_(61697,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aaa=new A.d0("What is recorded","Joins and leaves, files added, renamed, deleted and opened, screenshot attempts, and admin actions. It records who and when, never what a file says.",!1)
B.aa6=new A.d0("Visible to everyone in the group","Members see what admins do as easily as admins see members. Nobody gets a private log.",!1)
B.a9O=new A.d0("Tamper evidence","Entries are chained, so removing or editing one breaks the chain. Nothing can be quietly taken back, including by admins.",!1)
B.aqU=s([B.aaa,B.aa6,B.a9O],t.eH)
